OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1790434088
OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FAs the independent commission's
OL,7,Ffindings into Premier League financial
OL,8,Frule-breaking send shockwaves through
OL,9,Fthe football world, Manchester City
OL,10,Ffaces unprecedented reputational
OL,11,Ffallout.
OL,13,FFor a club that has dominated English
OL,14,Ffootball on the pitch for years, the
OL,15,Flegal scrutiny into how that dominance
OL,16,Fwas built threatens to overshadow more
OL,17,Fthan a decade of success.
OL,19,FAt the centre of the club's rise to
OL,20,Fglory is owner, Sheikh Mansour.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/12
