OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FWho is Sheikh Mansour?
OL,8,FSheikh Mansour bin Zayed bin Sultan Al
OL,9,FNahyan is a prominent Emirati royal,
OL,10,Fpolitician, and international
OL,11,Fbusinessman.
OL,13,FHe is the Vice President and Deputy
OL,14,FPrime Minister of the United Arab
OL,15,FEmirates, serves as the Minister of
OL,16,Fthe Presidential Court, and is a key
OL,17,Fmember of the ruling family of Abu
OL,18,FDhabi.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
