OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1790434088
OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FIn September 2008, Sheikh Mansour
OL,7,Facquired Manchester City for #200
OL,8,Fmillion through the Abu Dhabi United
OL,9,FGroup, instantly turning a mid-table
OL,10,Fclub into one of the wealthiest in the
OL,11,Fworld.
OL,13,FWhat happened to Manchester City when
OL,14,FMansour took over?
OL,16,FThe acquisition of Manchester City
OL,17,Frepresented a seismic shift in how
OL,18,Felite football clubs were funded.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,366,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1790434088
OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FWhere English football had previously
OL,7,Fseen local benefactors like Jack
OL,8,FWalker pump personal funds into his
OL,9,Fboyhood team Blackburn Rovers,
OL,10,Ffollowed by Russian billionaire Roman
OL,11,FAbramovich arriving at Chelsea with
OL,12,Fseemingly unlimited wealth, Sheikh
OL,13,FMansour topped them all.
OL,15,FCity now possessed financial strength
OL,16,Funlike anything previously seen in the
OL,17,Fdomestic game.
OL,19,F"From Ford Focus to Ferrari"
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
