FL,366,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1790434088
OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FThat new found financial muscle began
OL,7,Fto be flexed on the day the Sheikh
OL,8,Fagreed a deal to buy the club, with
OL,9,Fthe signing of Brazilian Robinho from
OL,10,FReal Madird for a British record
OL,11,Ftransfer fee of #32million.
OL,13,FIt was a statement of intent and a
OL,14,Fsign of things to come.
OL,16,FThe following seasons saw manager Mark
OL,17,FHughes leave the club and the
OL,18,Fappointment of Italian Roberto Mancini
OL,19,Fas well as a host of high profile
OL,20,Fplayers.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
