OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FFamously Argentina forward Carlos
OL,7,FTevez signed in 2009 following a two-
OL,8,Fyear spell at City's neighbours
OL,9,FManchester United.
OL,11,FThe club famously celebrated the deal
OL,12,Fwith the controversial "Welcome to
OL,13,FManchester" sky-blue billboard in the
OL,14,Fcity centre.
OL,16,FKieran Maguire, Football finance
OL,17,Fexpert from the University of
OL,18,FLiverpool said: "Manchester City had
OL,19,Fto go from the equivalent of going in
OL,20,Fa Ford Focus, while everyone else was
OL,21,Fin a Ferrari.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
