OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,F"So therefore they had to go and
OL,7,Foutspend the other clubs in order to
OL,8,Fcatch up."
OL,10,FTrophies and Dominance
OL,12,FJust three years after his takeover,
OL,13,FShiekh Mansour began to see a return
OL,14,Fon his lavish investment.
OL,16,FIn 2011, Yaya Toure's winning goal in
OL,17,Fthe FA Cup final against Stoke City at
OL,18,FWembley ended a 35-year major trophy
OL,19,Fdrought.
OL,26,@xD@Srr
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/12
