OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FThe season after, Sergio Aguero's
OL,7,Ficonic stoppage-time goal against QPR
OL,8,Fwon Manchester City the Premier League
OL,9,Ftitle on goal difference ahead of
OL,10,FManchester United.
OL,12,FAcross the core years covered by the
OL,13,FPremier League's investigation, City
OL,14,Famassed three Premier League Titles,
OL,15,Funder Roberto Mancini, Manuel
OL,16,FPellegrini and Pep Guardiola.
OL,18,FThey won three League Cups, one FA Cup
OL,19,Fand two Community Shields.
OL,26,@nD@\xz
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/12
