PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1790434088
OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FUnder Pep, City went on to win five
OL,7,FPremier League titles in six seasons,
OL,8,Fculminated by the 2023 Treble and FIFA
OL,9,FClub World Cup victory.
OL,11,FWhat does this mean for the club's
OL,12,Flegacy?
OL,14,FBut all that success will forever be
OL,15,Fquestioned - would it have happened if
OL,16,Fnot for their financial rule breaking
OL,17,Fon a scale never seen before in
OL,18,FEnglish football?
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
