PN,36510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1790434088
OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FFor all that glory, all those
OL,7,Ftriumphs, all those trophies,
OL,8,FManchester City's reputation is at an
OL,9,Fall time low.
OL,11,FWhat are the charges?
OL,13,FManchester City have been found guilty
OL,14,Fof breaking more than 100 financial
OL,15,Ffair play rules between the years of
OL,16,F2009 and 2018.
OL,18,FThe club were charged in February 2023
OL,19,Fwith more than 100 breaches of league
OL,20,Frules, charges which City strenuously
OL,21,Fdenied.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,366,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F365A1790434088
OL,3,CWho is Manchester City's owner Sheikh
OL,4,CMansour?
OL,6,FCity had been charged with failing to
OL,7,Freport accurate financial information
OL,8,Ffor nine seasons stretching from 2009-
OL,9,F10 to 2017-18, as well as failing to
OL,10,Fprovide full details of former manager
OL,11,FRoberto Mancini's pay between 2009-10
OL,12,Fand 2012-13.
OL,14,FThey were also charged with failing to
OL,15,Fprovide full details of remuneration
OL,16,Fin contracts with players between 2010-
OL,17,F11 and 2015-16, and with failing to co-
OL,18,Foperate with the investigation over a
OL,19,Fperiod from 2018 to 2023.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
